# Phase 7 - Validation

## Validation Steps

1. Open an Incident record.
2. Change State to Resolved.
3. Verify that Resolution Notes becomes mandatory.
4. Verify that Resolution Code becomes mandatory.
5. Try to submit without entering the fields.
6. Verify that the Client Script displays an alert.
7. Enter Resolution Notes.
8. Enter Resolution Code.
9. Submit the Incident.

## Expected Result

The Incident should be submitted only after the
required resolution information is provided.
